---
kind: lore
id: end.kai
title: Kai's endings
---

<beat id="lantern" on="termEnd" after="visited('kai.confession')" title="Kai — the lantern ending" priority="10" when="run.route == 'kai' && @devoted(run.aff.kai)">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The closing ceremony ends with a recital nobody put on the programme. A battered upright has been wheeled onto the stage, with a padlock hanging off its lid like an earring.
  @kai{code="0010" emotion="fond"}: Five bars. All five. Stand where I can see you, or I'll lose count.
  ::use{component="cg" id="cgKaiEnd" instance="use-001"}
  ::use{component="ending" who="kai" kind="good" title="Kai — the lantern ending" instance="use-001"}
</beat>

<beat id="ember" on="termEnd" after="visited('kai.confession')" title="Kai — the ember ending" priority="5" when="run.route == 'kai'">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The old music room is a store cupboard now. Someone has scratched five lines of music into the door frame.
  @kai{code="0010" vo emotion="sad"}: I kept the song. I just don't play it where people can hear.
  ::use{component="ending" who="kai" kind="bittersweet" title="Kai — the ember ending" instance="use-002"}
</beat>
